@page "/"
@using Netto.Web.Client.Tabs
@inject NavigationManager Navigation

@* The app opens on the plan: this address draws no page, it replaces itself with /plan as it is first
   drawn, so Back from the plan goes to what the viewer came from and not round to / again. The front page
   is at /about (FrontPage). The app's own links go to /plan, never here: a link to this address leaves
   the plan page, whose component is rebuilt and forgets what it had found, where /plan from one of its
   tabs keeps it. It runs in the browser only, as every page does (Routes), so the server never
   navigates. *@

@code {
    protected override void OnInitialized() =>
        Navigation.NavigateTo(PlanTabRoutes.Href(PlanTab.Plan), replace: true);
}
